    "Actual transformed components, hard source counts and maximum totalspans pass; all attached solids have measured triangle/base contact and nonzero dense full-scene exposure. Nonzero exposure alone is not a visual approval. No invented exposure-percent cutoff.",
    "Original delivered source and GLB solids are closed and outward consistently wound without diagnostic repairs, mesh welding or normal recalculation. Source production normals are saved before original audits.",
    "Two different actual Blender PIDs per asset and exact queued input hashes support semantic rebuilds; no manufactured loop counters as execution proof."
